#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/algorithms.md:31
msgid ""
"The product supplies physical units, sampling continuity, coefficient design"
" and the response to missed samples. PID gains use continuous-time Ki/Kd; do"
" not apply the sample interval twice. Anti-windup and explicit actual-output"
" feedback do not establish stability of a physical plant. Numeric rejection "
"is not an actuator shutdown command. Preserve IEEE nonfinite checks when "
"compiling this profile; fast-math assumptions cannot replace its input "
"contract."
msgstr ""
"产品提供物理单位、采样连续性、系数设计及丢样处置。PID 使用连续时间 "
"Ki／Kd，不得重复应用采样间隔。抗积分饱和及显式实际输出反馈不建立物理控制对象的稳定性。数值拒绝不是执行器停机命令。编译此 profile 时保留 "
"IEEE 非有限值检查，fast-math 假设不能替代其输入合同。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/algorithms.md:38
msgid ""
"Portable SOS computes into separate scratch and commits history only after a"
" successful step. Scratch may change on failure. Exact input/output "
"separation, startup history and reset conditions remain those of the "
"selected header; a generic reset must not race a live caller."
msgstr ""
"可移植 SOS 在独立 scratch 中计算，仅成功 step 后提交历史。失败可能改变 scratch。精确输入／输出分离、启动历史与 reset "
"条件以选定头文件为准；通用 reset 不得与 live 调用者竞态。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/algorithms.md:43
msgid ""
"Motion tracking requires a product-proven displacement bound between "
"samples. It cannot reconstruct missed full counter wraps. The first sample "
"establishes the raw reference without claiming mechanical zero or valid "
"velocity. After a time discontinuity, reinitialize the tracker explicitly. "
"Calibration and target parameters must come from one consistently published "
"version."
msgstr ""
"运动跟踪要求产品证明相邻样本之间的位移上界。它无法重建遗漏的完整计数器回绕。首个样本仅建立原始计数参考，不代表机械零位，也不产生有效速度。时间发生不连续后，必须显式重新初始化跟踪器。校准和目标参数必须来自同一个一致发布的版本。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/algorithms.md:49
msgid ""
"Trajectory planning runs in the caller's planning context and may use double"
" precision and square root. Evaluation uses binary32 and explicit elapsed "
"seconds. Reaching the commanded endpoint does not prove measured position, "
"output withdrawal or physical stopping. The selected hardware provider "
"defines which feedback and output methods can run in an interrupt."
msgstr ""
"轨迹规划在调用者选择的规划上下文中运行，可能使用双精度和平方根。轨迹求值使用 "
"binary32，并显式接收经过的秒数。命令到达终点不证明实测位置、输出已经撤回或机构已经停止。哪些反馈和输出方法可在中断内调用，由选定的硬件 "
"provider 规定。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/algorithms.md:55
msgid ""
"The six-axis attitude estimator consumes calibrated angular rate in rad/s, "
"specific force in m/s² and an explicit continuous `dt_s`. Mounting rotation "
"is separate from per-axis calibration. An acceleration norm outside the "
"selected window skips gravity correction and reports that fact. Without an "
"external heading reference, yaw remains relative and drifts; sustained "
"acceleration can also bias tilt. These bounded binary32 operations use "
"transcendental functions; the caller must budget their actual execution/FPU "
"context. They do not establish sample pairing, an aperture timestamp or "
"physical estimator accuracy."
msgstr ""
"六轴姿态估计器接收已校准的角速度（rad/s）、比力（m/s²）以及显式、连续的 "
"`dt_s`。安装旋转与逐轴校准分开处理。加速度模长超出选定窗口时，跳过重力修正并报告此事实。没有外部航向参考时，偏航角保持相对值并会漂移；持续加速度也可能使倾角产生偏差。这些有界"
" binary32 运算使用超越函数；调用者必须为实际执行时间和 FPU 上下文安排预算。它们不保证样本配对、采样时刻时间戳或物理估计精度。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/algorithms.md:64
msgid "Conditional CMSIS-DSP backend"
msgstr "条件 CMSIS-DSP backend"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/algorithms.md:66
msgid ""
"Explicit `nexus_add_cmsis_dsp()` selection creates the locked upstream "
"`Nexus::CMSISDSP` backend and the Nexus-facing `Nexus::AlgorithmsCMSISDSP` "
"adapter. Ordinary Algorithms does not select that dependency. The reviewed "
"[f32 profile](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/components/algorithms/cmsis_dsp/README.md) includes dot, scalar FIR, "
"DF1 biquad and fixed RFFT1024, with caller-provided history and FFT "
"workspace. Vendor headers remain private."
msgstr ""
"显式选择 `nexus_add_cmsis_dsp()` 后，才创建锁定的上游 `Nexus::CMSISDSP` backend 和面向 Nexus "
"的 `Nexus::AlgorithmsCMSISDSP` adapter。普通 Algorithms 不选择该依赖。已审[f32 "
"profile](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/components/algorithms/cmsis_dsp/README.md)包含 dot、scalar FIR、DF1 "
"biquad 和固定 RFFT1024，历史和 FFT workspace 均由调用者提供。vendor 头保持私有。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/algorithms.md:73
msgid ""
"CMSIS FIR coefficient order and biquad feedback signs differ from the "
"portable profile. Do not reuse those arrays without conversion. CMSIS block "
"processing does not inherit portable SOS history rollback. RFFT output is "
"packed as `[DC, Nyquist, Re(1), Im(1), ...]`, with no forward normalization;"
" the caller owns sample rate, window and spectral units. MCU cycle budgets "
"and physical sampling/control qualification remain `not_executed` unless "
"their exact target and hardware are separately exercised."
msgstr ""
"CMSIS FIR 的系数顺序和 biquad 反馈符号与可移植 profile 不同，未转换前不得复用数组。CMSIS block "
"processing 不继承可移植 SOS 的历史回滚。RFFT 输出打包为 `[DC, Nyquist, Re(1), Im(1), "
"...]`，正向不归一化；采样率、窗函数与频谱单位归调用者。除非另行执行精确 target 和硬件，MCU 周期预算与物理采样／控制资格保持 "
"`not_executed`。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/algorithms.md:81
msgid "Conditional CMSIS-NN backend"
msgstr "按需选择的 CMSIS-NN 后端"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/algorithms.md:83
msgid ""
"Explicit `nexus_add_cmsis_nn()` creates `Nexus::AlgorithmsCMSISNN` over the "
"locked CMSIS-NN signed-int8 fully-connected kernels. Ordinary Algorithms "
"does not select it. The [selected profile](https://github.com/X-Gen-"
"Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/components/algorithms/cmsis_nn/README.md) is one batch, 1..1024 "
"inputs and 1..256 outputs, output-major weights, optional accumulator-unit "
"bias, positive Q31 multiplier and shift -30..0. Shapes and a conservative "
"accumulator bound are checked before output access."
msgstr ""
"显式调用 `nexus_add_cmsis_nn()`，基于锁定的 CMSIS-NN 有符号 int8 全连接内核创建 "
"`Nexus::AlgorithmsCMSISNN`。普通 Algorithms "
"不会选择该后端。[选定配置](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/components/algorithms/cmsis_nn/README.md)仅支持单批次、1..1024 个输入和 1..256 "
"个输出，权重按输出优先排列，可选偏置采用累加器单位，Q31 乘数为正，移位范围为 -30..0。在访问输出前检查形状和保守的累加器上界。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/algorithms.md:90
msgid ""
"The Native/M4 profile requires no heap, retained state or workspace. Input, "
"weights, bias and configuration remain immutable during the synchronous "
"call; the entire advertised output span is disjoint from those inputs. Work "
"is bounded by the selected shape, not preempted by a deadline. The product "
"owns feature extraction, scaling, scheduling and model validity. A fixed "
"numerical graph is not a trained classifier or an actuator command policy; "
"see the [control and smart-device guide](../../../guides/control-and-smart-"
"devices.md)."
msgstr ""
"Native/M4 "
"配置不需要堆、保留状态或工作区。同步调用期间，输入、权重、偏置和配置必须保持不变；声明的整个输出范围不得与这些输入重叠。工作量由选定形状限定，不会因 "
"deadline "
"到达而被抢占。产品负责特征提取、缩放、调度和模型有效性。固定的数值计算图不等于训练完成的分类器，也不等于执行器命令策略；参见[控制与智能设备指南](../../../guides/control-"
"and-smart-devices.md)。"

