#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/algorithms.md:144
msgid ""
"Pure Task/IRQ calculation without clock, device, heap or retained "
"references. The caller owns validity, identity, version, units and "
"activation. Both coefficients come from one serialized snapshot."
msgstr ""
"可在 Task/IRQ 中执行的纯计算，不访问时钟、设备或堆，也不保留引用。调用者负责有效性、身份、版本、单位和启用。两个系数必须来自同一个串行化快照。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/algorithms.md:144
msgid "[in] Stable finite offset and scale; zero allowed."
msgstr "[in] 稳定且有限的偏移和比例，允许为零。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/algorithms.md:144
msgid "[in] Finite raw measurement."
msgstr "[in] 有限的原始测量值。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/algorithms.md:144
#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/algorithms.md:150
msgid "[out] Separate aligned output, unchanged on failure."
msgstr "[out] 独立、对齐的输出，失败时保持不变。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/algorithms.md:144
#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/algorithms.md:156
msgid "SUCCESS, INVALID or EXHAUSTED for intermediate overflow."
msgstr "SUCCESS、INVALID，或在中间运算溢出时返回 EXHAUSTED。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/algorithms.md:144
msgid "Product-selected raw offset and output units per raw unit."
msgstr "由产品选择的原始偏移，以及每个原始单位对应的输出单位。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/algorithms.md:148
msgid "motion.h"
msgstr "motion.h"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/algorithms.md:150
msgid "Explicit modulo feedback and rest-to-rest motion profiles."
msgstr "显式模计数反馈与静止到静止运动曲线。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/algorithms.md:150
msgid "Reduce an angle into [-pi, pi), in radians."
msgstr "将角度归约到 [-pi, pi)，单位为弧度。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/algorithms.md:150
msgid ""
"Pure Task/IRQ calculation; large arguments retain only binary32 precision, "
"not an exact mathematical turn count. No clock, heap or retained state."
msgstr "可在 Task/IRQ 中执行的纯计算；大参数只保留 binary32 精度，不保留精确的数学圈数。不访问时钟或堆，也不保留状态。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/algorithms.md:150
msgid "[in] Finite angle, reduced using binary32 pi constants."
msgstr "[in] 有限角度，使用 binary32 的 pi 常数归约。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/algorithms.md:150
msgid "[out] Aligned output, unchanged on rejection."
msgstr "[out] 对齐的输出，拒绝时保持不变。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/algorithms.md:150
msgid "Configure one bounded modulo tracker without a sample."
msgstr "配置一个有界模计数跟踪器，不采集样本。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/algorithms.md:150
msgid ""
"The first step establishes the raw reference without assuming a mechanical "
"zero or valid velocity. Task/IRQ pure metadata work; caller serializes all "
"state access."
msgstr ""
"首次 step 建立原始计数参考，不假设机械零位，也不产生有效速度。可在 Task/IRQ 中执行的纯元数据操作；调用者须串行化所有状态访问。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/algorithms.md:150
msgid "[out] Aligned exclusive state, unchanged on rejection."
msgstr "[out] 对齐且独占的状态，拒绝时保持不变。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/algorithms.md:150
msgid "[in] Counter range 2..2^32, not its maximum count."
msgstr "[in] 计数器范围 2..2^32，不是最大计数值。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/algorithms.md:150
msgid ""
"[in] Largest permitted displacement, strictly smaller than half the modulus;"
" zero allowed."
msgstr "[in] 允许的最大位移，必须严格小于模数的一半；允许为零。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/algorithms.md:150
msgid "[in] Product-selected initial relative count."
msgstr "[in] 产品选择的初始相对计数。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/algorithms.md:150
msgid "SUCCESS or INVALID; no allocation or retained reference."
msgstr "SUCCESS 或 INVALID；不分配内存，也不保留引用。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/algorithms.md:150
msgid "Unwrap one bounded count and estimate interval velocity."
msgstr "展开一个有界计数，并估计区间速度。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/algorithms.md:150
msgid ""
"Pure Task/IRQ calculation. Excessive or ambiguous movement returns STATE; "
"count or velocity overflow is EXHAUSTED. First success has "
"velocity_valid=false, while dt_s must still be valid. Caller proves bounded "
"displacement; missed full wraps cannot be detected. Reinitialize after a "
"timing discontinuity. Velocity is an interval average in binary32, not an "
"edge timestamp. No device, clock, heap or hidden history."
msgstr ""
"可在 Task/IRQ 中执行的纯计算。位移过大或存在歧义时返回 STATE；计数或速度溢出时返回 EXHAUSTED。首次成功时 "
"velocity_valid=false，但 dt_s 仍须有效。调用者必须证明位移有界；无法检测遗漏的完整回绕。时间不连续后必须重新初始化。速度是 "
"binary32 表示的区间平均值，不是边沿时间戳。不访问设备、时钟或堆，也没有隐藏历史。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/algorithms.md:150
msgid "[inout] Initialized same-owner state, disjoint from out."
msgstr "[inout] 已初始化、由同一所有者持有的状态，不得与 out 重叠。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/algorithms.md:150
msgid "[in] Current count, strictly less than the modulus."
msgstr "[in] 当前计数，必须严格小于模数。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/algorithms.md:150
msgid "[in] Finite nonzero scale; sign allowed."
msgstr "[in] 有限且非零的比例，允许为负。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/algorithms.md:150
msgid "[in] Finite positive interval in seconds."
msgstr "[in] 有限且为正的时间间隔，单位为秒。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/algorithms.md:150
msgid "[out] Separate aligned estimate, unchanged on failure."
msgstr "[out] 独立、对齐的估计结果，失败时保持不变。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/algorithms.md:150
#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/algorithms.md:156
msgid "SUCCESS, INVALID, STATE or EXHAUSTED; failure keeps state."
msgstr "SUCCESS、INVALID、STATE 或 EXHAUSTED；失败时状态保持不变。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/algorithms.md:150
msgid "Plan a rest-to-rest move with bounded speed/acceleration."
msgstr "规划速度和加速度有界的静止到静止运动。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/algorithms.md:150
msgid ""
"Caller selects a planning context: initialization uses double/sqrt to "
"calculate phase times; no clock or heap. Evaluation is binary32 only. The "
"move starts and ends at zero velocity, with discontinuous acceleration; no "
"jerk, moving-target replanning, braking or physical stability promise. Join "
"old users before replacing a live plan."
msgstr ""
"调用者选择规划上下文：初始化使用 double/sqrt 计算各阶段时间，不访问时钟或堆。求值仅使用 "
"binary32。运动的起点和终点速度均为零，加速度不连续；不承诺加加速度限制、运动中目标重规划、制动或物理稳定性。替换正在使用的规划前，必须等待旧使用者全部结束访问。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/algorithms.md:150
msgid "[out] Aligned exclusive result, unchanged on failure."
msgstr "[out] 对齐且独占的结果，失败时保持不变。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/algorithms.md:150
msgid "[in] Finite initial commanded position."
msgstr "[in] 有限的初始命令位置。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/algorithms.md:150
msgid "[in] Finite final commanded position."
msgstr "[in] 有限的最终命令位置。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/algorithms.md:150
msgid "[in] Finite positive units per second."
msgstr "[in] 有限且为正的速度，单位为位置单位/秒。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/algorithms.md:150
msgid "[in] Finite positive units per second squared."
msgstr "[in] 有限且为正的加速度，单位为位置单位/秒²。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/algorithms.md:150
msgid ""
"SUCCESS, INVALID or EXHAUSTED when the distance/timing cannot be represented"
" by the selected binary32 profile."
msgstr "SUCCESS、INVALID，或在选定 binary32 配置无法表示距离或时间时返回 EXHAUSTED。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/algorithms.md:150
msgid "Evaluate the immutable plan at explicit elapsed seconds."
msgstr "按照显式经过的秒数，对不可变规划求值。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/algorithms.md:150
msgid ""
"Pure Task/IRQ bounded binary32 calculation without clock, sqrt, heap or "
"mutable history. At/after total_s, returns the exact target with zero "
"velocity/acceleration and complete=true. Clock epoch changes invalidate the "
"caller's elapsed-time origin. Complete is a command fact, not proof of "
"actuator position, output withdrawal or safe stopping."
msgstr ""
"可在 Task/IRQ 中执行的有界 binary32 纯计算，不访问时钟、sqrt 或堆，也不保留可变历史。到达或超过 total_s "
"时，返回精确目标、零速度、零加速度和 complete=true。时钟 epoch 变化会使调用者的经过时间起点失效。Complete "
"表示命令已完成，不证明执行器位置、输出已经撤回或已经安全停止。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/algorithms.md:150
msgid "[in] Valid unmodified result from nx_trajectory_plan."
msgstr "[in] nx_trajectory_plan 产生的有效且未修改的结果。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/algorithms.md:150
msgid "[in] Finite nonnegative seconds from the same start."
msgstr "[in] 相对于同一起点的有限非负秒数。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/algorithms.md:150
msgid "SUCCESS, INVALID or EXHAUSTED for arithmetic overflow."
msgstr "SUCCESS、INVALID，或在算术溢出时返回 EXHAUSTED。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/algorithms.md:150
msgid "Caller-owned modulo tracker, initialized before the first sample."
msgstr "调用者持有的模计数跟踪器，在首个样本前初始化。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/algorithms.md:150
msgid ""
"Reset/reinitialization requires every user to join. Configuration is "
"immutable between initialization and that join. No hardware is read."
msgstr "复位或重新初始化前，必须等待所有使用者结束访问。从初始化到此次等待完成之前，配置保持不变。不读取硬件。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/algorithms.md:150
msgid "Relative count estimate; velocity uses caller-selected units/second."
msgstr "相对计数估计；速度采用调用者选择的单位/秒。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/algorithms.md:150
msgid "Immutable planned trapezoid, or triangle when the move is short."
msgstr "不可变的梯形规划；短距离运动采用三角形规划。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/algorithms.md:150
msgid ""
"Create using nx_trajectory_plan and retain unchanged for evaluation. "
"Position units are selected by the caller; time units are seconds."
msgstr "通过 nx_trajectory_plan 创建，并在求值期间保持不变。位置单位由调用者选择，时间单位为秒。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/algorithms.md:150
msgid "Kinematic target, not a measured actuator state or stop guarantee."
msgstr "运动学目标，不是执行器实测状态，也不保证停止。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/algorithms.md:154
msgid "attitude.h"
msgstr "attitude.h"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/algorithms.md:156
msgid "Calibrated vectors and explicit six-axis attitude estimate."
msgstr "校准向量与显式六轴姿态估计。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/algorithms.md:156
msgid "Calibrate all axes, publishing only a complete result."
msgstr "校准所有轴，仅在结果完整时发布。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/algorithms.md:156
msgid ""
"Pure Task/IRQ binary32 work; no clock, heap or references. Product owns "
"calibration identity, units and validity."
msgstr "可在 Task/IRQ 中执行的 binary32 纯计算，不访问时钟或堆，也不保留引用。产品负责校准身份、单位和有效性。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/algorithms.md:156
msgid "[in] Stable finite coefficients, separate from out."
msgstr "[in] 稳定且有限的系数，不得与 out 重叠。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/algorithms.md:156
msgid "[in] Finite input vector in native sensor axes."
msgstr "[in] 传感器原生轴坐标系中的有限输入向量。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/algorithms.md:156
msgid "[out] Aligned output, unchanged on any failure."
msgstr "[out] 对齐的输出，任何失败均保持不变。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/algorithms.md:156
msgid "Normalize a finite nonzero quaternion with scaled norm."
msgstr "使用缩放范数归一化有限非零四元数。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/algorithms.md:156
msgid ""
"Pure Task/IRQ binary32 calculation using sqrtf; no clock, allocation or "
"retained state. Both q and -q describe the same rotation; no canonical sign "
"is selected."
msgstr ""
"可在 Task/IRQ 中执行的 binary32 纯计算，使用 sqrtf；不访问时钟、不分配内存，也不保留状态。q 和 -q "
"表示同一旋转，不选择规范符号。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/algorithms.md:156
msgid "[in] Finite Hamilton quaternion; any nonzero scale."
msgstr "[in] 有限的 Hamilton 四元数，尺度可为任意非零值。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/algorithms.md:156
msgid "[out] Aligned result, unchanged on rejection."
msgstr "[out] 对齐的结果，拒绝时保持不变。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/algorithms.md:156
msgid "SUCCESS or INVALID for zero/nonfinite values or NULL out."
msgstr "SUCCESS，或在数值为零、非有限值或 out 为 NULL 时返回 INVALID。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/algorithms.md:156
msgid "Rotate a body vector into world using a normalized copy."
msgstr "使用归一化副本，将机体向量旋转至世界坐标系。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/algorithms.md:156
msgid "Pure Task/IRQ calculation, no retained state or allocation."
msgstr "可在 Task/IRQ 中执行的纯计算，不保留状态，也不分配内存。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/algorithms.md:156
msgid "[in] Finite nonzero body-to-world quaternion."
msgstr "[in] 有限非零的机体到世界坐标系四元数。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/algorithms.md:156
msgid "[in] Finite body-frame vector."
msgstr "[in] 机体坐标系中的有限向量。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/algorithms.md:156
msgid "[out] Aligned output, unchanged on failure."
msgstr "[out] 对齐的输出，失败时保持不变。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/algorithms.md:156
msgid "SUCCESS, INVALID or EXHAUSTED for binary32 overflow."
msgstr "SUCCESS、INVALID，或在 binary32 溢出时返回 EXHAUSTED。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/algorithms.md:156
msgid "Initialize orientation from an explicit initial estimate."
msgstr "根据显式初始估计，初始化姿态。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/algorithms.md:156
msgid ""
"No automatic attitude, axis, bias or heading discovery. Join old users "
"before reinitialization; no clock or heap."
msgstr "不自动发现姿态、轴、偏置或航向。重新初始化前，必须等待旧使用者结束访问；不访问时钟或堆。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/algorithms.md:156
msgid "[out] Aligned exclusive state, unchanged on failure."
msgstr "[out] 对齐且独占的状态，失败时保持不变。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/algorithms.md:156
msgid "[in] Nonzero finite body-to-world quaternion."
msgstr "[in] 非零、有限的机体到世界坐标系四元数。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/algorithms.md:156
msgid "SUCCESS or INVALID; normalizes initial before publishing."
msgstr "SUCCESS 或 INVALID；发布前先归一化 initial。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/algorithms.md:156
msgid "Integrate gyro with proportional gravity-vector correction."
msgstr "结合重力向量比例修正，对陀螺仪数据积分。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/algorithms.md:156
msgid ""
"Right-handed Hamilton body-to-world rotation; rest at identity observes "
"positive Z acceleration. Norm outside the inclusive configured acceleration "
"window skips correction and reports acceleration_used=false. Gain may be "
"zero. Corrected rotation step exceeding maximum_step_rad returns STATE; that"
" limit is positive and at most 1 radian. Caller owns sample pairing, time "
"continuity, bias and quality. Yaw is relative and drifts without an external"
" reference; sustained acceleration can also bias tilt. This is a selected "
"six-axis proportional complementary estimator, not an EKF, position "
"estimator or stability certificate. Pure bounded binary32 math uses "
"sqrtf/sinf/cosf; choose an execution/FPU budget. No device, clock, worker or"
" heap."
msgstr ""
"采用右手系 Hamilton 四元数，表示机体到世界坐标系的旋转；姿态为单位旋转且静止时，观测到正 Z "
"方向加速度。加速度模长超出配置的闭区间窗口时，跳过修正并报告 acceleration_used=false。增益可以为零。修正后的旋转步长超过 "
"maximum_step_rad 时返回 STATE；此上限必须为正且不超过 1 "
"弧度。调用者负责样本配对、时间连续性、偏置和质量。没有外部参考时，偏航角为相对值并会漂移；持续加速度也可能使倾角产生偏差。这是选定的六轴比例互补估计器，不是"
" EKF、位置估计器或稳定性证明。有界 binary32 纯运算使用 sqrtf/sinf/cosf；须选择执行时间和 FPU "
"预算。不访问设备、时钟、工作线程或堆。"

