msgstr "调用者设计／验证系数及 f32 动态范围。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/algorithms.md:174
msgid "[out] Fresh single-owner control."
msgstr "[out] fresh 单 owner 控制。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/algorithms.md:174
msgid ""
"[in] 5*sections immutable floats in CMSIS order {b0,b1,b2,a1,a2}; feedback "
"signs are positive in the equation."
msgstr "[in] 5*sections 个不可变 float，按 CMSIS 顺序 {b0,b1,b2,a1,a2}；方程中的反馈符号为正。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/algorithms.md:174
msgid "[in] Positive count fitting uint8_t."
msgstr "[in] 可由 uint8_t 表示的正数数量。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/algorithms.md:174
msgid "[inout] Distinct retained writable history buffer."
msgstr "[inout] 独立、保持存活的可写 history buffer。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/algorithms.md:174
msgid "[in] At least 4*sections floats."
msgstr "[in] 至少 4*sections 个 float。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/algorithms.md:174
msgid "SUCCESS or INVALID; no partial clearing on rejection."
msgstr "SUCCESS 或 INVALID；拒绝时不部分清零。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/algorithms.md:174
msgid "Process a finite block using actual CMSIS DF1 code."
msgstr "使用真实 CMSIS DF1 代码处理有限 block。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/algorithms.md:174
msgid "No allocation/clock/OS; upstream commits history and output."
msgstr "无分配／clock／OS；上游直接提交历史和输出。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/algorithms.md:174
msgid "[inout] Live single-owner control/history."
msgstr "[inout] live 单 owner 控制／历史。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/algorithms.md:174
msgid "[in] count readable finite floats."
msgstr "[in] count 个可读有限 float。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/algorithms.md:174
msgid "[out] count distinct writable floats."
msgstr "[out] count 个独立可写 float。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/algorithms.md:174
msgid "[in] Positive finite block length."
msgstr "[in] 有限正数 block 长度。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/algorithms.md:174
msgid "Forward real FFT of exactly 1024 samples using upstream code."
msgstr "使用上游代码对恰好 1024 个样本执行正向 real FFT。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/algorithms.md:174
msgid ""
"Packed [DC,Nyquist,Re(1),Im(1),...] is unnormalized. Real kernel/table "
"sources are selected explicitly; no substitute transform, allocation, "
"background task or automatic window. Caller budgets dynamic range and "
"signal/sample-rate units."
msgstr ""
"打包的 [DC,Nyquist,Re(1),Im(1),...] 不归一化。显式选择真实 kernel／table 源码；没有替代变换、分配、后台 "
"task 或自动窗函数。调用者核算动态范围并确定信号／采样率单位。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/algorithms.md:174
msgid "[in] Exactly 1024 finite floats, borrowed until return."
msgstr "[in] 恰好 1024 个有限 float，借用到返回。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/algorithms.md:174
msgid "[inout] Distinct 1024 writable floats for mutable input."
msgstr "[inout] 独立的 1024 个可写 float，用作可变输入。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/algorithms.md:174
msgid "[out] Distinct 1024 writable floats, packed CMSIS order."
msgstr "[out] 独立的 1024 个可写 float，使用 packed CMSIS 顺序。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/algorithms.md:174
msgid "SUCCESS, INVALID or STATE if upstream init rejects profile."
msgstr "上游 init 拒绝 profile 时为 STATE，否则 SUCCESS 或 INVALID。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/algorithms.md:174
msgid "Retained reversed coefficients and caller-owned scalar FIR history."
msgstr "保持存活的倒序系数和调用者拥有的 scalar FIR 历史。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/algorithms.md:174
msgid "Retained CMSIS DF1 coefficients and four history floats per section."
msgstr "保持存活的 CMSIS DF1 系数，每 section 四个 history float。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/algorithms.md:178
msgid "cmsis_nn.h"
msgstr "cmsis_nn.h"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/algorithms.md:180
msgid "Explicit bounded CMSIS-NN signed-byte dense profile."
msgstr "显式、有界的 CMSIS-NN 有符号字节全连接配置。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/algorithms.md:180
msgid "Evaluate one selected upstream quantized dense layer."
msgstr "对一层选定的上游量化全连接层求值。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/algorithms.md:180
msgid ""
"Caller serializes buffer access. This Native/M4 profile uses no heap, "
"device, clock, retained state or workspace. Work is bounded by the selected "
"tensor shape; the caller chooses an execution context with a sufficient "
"budget. Model training, tensor scaling and classification policy remain "
"external. Positive shifts and arbitrary models are outside this reviewed "
"profile."
msgstr ""
"调用者串行化缓冲区访问。此 Native/M4 "
"配置不使用堆、设备、时钟、保留状态或工作区。工作量由选定张量形状限定；调用者选择预算充足的执行上下文。模型训练、张量缩放和分类策略由外部负责。正移位和任意模型不在此已审查配置的范围内。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/algorithms.md:180
msgid "[in] Stable aligned configuration and immutable tensors."
msgstr "[in] 稳定、对齐的配置与不可变张量。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/algorithms.md:180
msgid "[in] Readable signed-byte vector in the declared scale."
msgstr "[in] 可读的有符号字节向量，采用声明的尺度。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/algorithms.md:180
msgid "[in] Complete input capacity, at least inputs."
msgstr "[in] 完整输入容量，至少为 inputs。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/algorithms.md:180
msgid "[out] Writable vector, disjoint from all inputs/config."
msgstr "[out] 可写向量，不得与任何输入或配置重叠。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/algorithms.md:180
msgid "[in] Complete output capacity, at least outputs."
msgstr "[in] 完整输出容量，至少为 outputs。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/algorithms.md:180
msgid ""
"SUCCESS, INVALID before output access, or IO for a backend failure with "
"unspecified output. No references survive."
msgstr "SUCCESS；访问输出前可返回 INVALID；后端失败时返回 IO，输出未定义。调用结束后不保留任何引用。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/algorithms.md:180
msgid "Immutable single-batch dense layer with row-major signed weights."
msgstr "不可变的单批次全连接层，使用行优先的有符号权重。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/algorithms.md:180
msgid ""
"inputs is 1..1024, outputs is 1..256. weights has inputs*outputs bytes. "
"Optional naturally aligned bias has outputs signed words. Quantization is "
"multiplier in 1..INT32_MAX and shift in -30..0; input_offset is -127..128, "
"output_offset is -128..127. Activation limits are ordered signed-byte "
"values. The conservative accumulator bound requires abs(bias[i]) <= "
"INT32_MAX-256-32768*inputs."
msgstr ""
"inputs 范围为 1..1024，outputs 范围为 1..256。weights 包含 inputs*outputs 字节。可选的自然对齐 "
"bias 包含 outputs 个有符号字。量化 multiplier 范围为 1..INT32_MAX，shift 范围为 "
"-30..0；input_offset 为 -127..128，output_offset 为 "
"-128..127。激活上下限是有序的有符号字节值。保守的累加器边界要求 abs(bias[i]) <= "
"INT32_MAX-256-32768*inputs。"
